---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer — REBELVAULT"
  description="Disclaimer for REBELVAULT."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        REBELVAULT
      </div>

      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

      <p class="legal-intro">
        REBELVAULT provides movie discovery information and access to
        third-party content. Please read this information before using
        the website.
      </p>

      <div class="legal-meta">
        Last updated: September 2026
      </div>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Movie Information</h2>

        <p>
          Movie titles, descriptions, release years, genres, artwork and
          other information displayed on REBELVAULT may come from
          different sources and may not always be complete or accurate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Third-Party Content</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may display or link to content hosted by third-party
          services. REBELVAULT does not control the content, availability,
          ownership or policies of those third-party services.
        </p>

        <p>
          Third-party content remains the responsibility of the service
          hosting or publishing it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Embedded Video Players</h2>

        <p>
          Some movie pages may contain embedded video players. These
          players are supplied by external services and may be subject to
          their own terms, privacy policies and copyright procedures.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT does not claim ownership of third-party video content
          simply because it is displayed through an embedded player.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. External Links</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may contain links that take visitors to external
          websites. We are not responsible for the content, availability,
          security, privacy practices or policies of external websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Advertising</h2>

        <p>
          Advertisements displayed on REBELVAULT may be provided by
          third-party advertising networks. The presence of an
          advertisement does not constitute an endorsement or guarantee
          of the advertised product or service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. No Guarantee of Availability</h2>

        <p>
          Movie listings, embedded videos and external links may become
          unavailable, change or be removed without notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Copyright Concerns</h2>

        <p>
          Copyright owners who believe that material associated with
          REBELVAULT infringes their rights should use the procedure
          described on the DMCA / Copyright page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. No Legal Advice</h2>

        <p>
          Nothing on REBELVAULT should be considered legal advice. If you
          have a specific legal question concerning copyright, licensing,
          privacy or another legal matter, consult a qualified
          professional.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a href="/" class="legal-back">
        ← BACK TO REBELVAULT
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      padding: 90px 24px 110px;
    }

    .legal-inner {
      width: min(850px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .legal-inner h1 {
      margin: 14px 0 24px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .legal-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #b4bac3;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-meta {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #666c75;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-top: 52px;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .legal-section p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #9da3ad;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .legal-back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 52px;
      color: #ff4938;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-back:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
